card.statement:
The following conditions are equivalent:

- $\bar{q}$ is generic;

- there exists $\phi\in\widehat{R^\circ}$ such that $\stab_{\Z^n}(\phi)=\{0_{\Z^n}\}$;

- for all $\phi\in\widehat{R^\circ}$, $\stab_{\Z^n}(\phi)=\{0_{\Z^n}\}$, in other words the action of $\Z^n$ on $\widehat{R^\circ}$ is free.
